    ],
    "text": {
     "en": "Welcome to House of Hundreds. Ajji, Teji and Jojo are at the mela with many things to count.\nFirst guess, then count. Two hundred triangles plus 5 more tens makes 250 triangles on the toran.\nFor bangles Teji counts in tens: 10, 20, 30, up to 200, then 210 and on to 280. So 200 and 80 more is 280 bangles.\nFor toffees they count 10, 20, 30 up to 290, then 291, 292 up to 298. 298 and one more is 299, and 299 and one more is 300.\nTen tens make a hundred. So 100 is a bundle of ten tens.\nEvery number has hundreds, tens and ones. 280 is 2 hundreds, 8 tens and 0 ones.\n300 is three hundreds. The numbers go 298, 299, 300, 301.\nOn a path of tiles, fill the empty tiles by counting forward or backward by one."
    }
